# This app is a fully static Next.js export (`output: "export"`) served from
# GitHub Pages. There is no server runtime, so no API keys, secrets, or URLs
# are required at build time or runtime.

# Optional. Path prefix used by the static export when hosted under a subpath
# (e.g. "/LevelUp" on GitHub Pages). Defaults to "".
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH="/LevelUp"

# Not used: GEMINI_API_KEY, APP_URL. This codebase contains no server-side
# Gemini calls, no OAuth callbacks, and no self-referential API endpoints —
# those variables belonged to the old AI Studio applet scaffolding and were
# removed. Anything you see here reflects what the code actually reads.